<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan March forex reserves down to $1.623 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan March forex reserves down to $1.623 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the monthly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan issued by the State (central) Bank of Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (MLN DLRS)		MARCH	FEB	  MARCH 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			   1,623	1,679	2,303</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	     561	  521	  937</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan	384	  480	  657</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion	676	  676	  702</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights	  2	    2	    7</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
